          "english_quote": "because hospitality sometimes gives an opportunity to do good",
          "issue": "Independently compared with the Greek, this wording changes beneficence sometimes found in hospitality into an opportunity supplied by hospitality. It preserves “sometimes” but replaces the asserted doing of good with a possibility of doing it.",
